@cooked2
on-arrival: dnvp_party_leader = "Kuno von Westarp"; dnvp_ideology = "National Conservatism"; old_middle_dnvp += 5; rural_dnvp += 3; workers_dnvp -= 3; new_middle_dnvp -= 5; pro_republic -= 5; nationalism += 5; dnvp_relation -= 20; lambach_defection = 1; {!

Q.parties.push('csvd');
Q.csvd_flee = 1;
Q.workers_dnvp *= 0.3;
Q.middle_class_dnvp *= 0.45;
Q.old_middle_dnvp *= 0.89;
Q.workers_csvd += 15;
Q.new_middle_csvd += 15;
Q.old_middle_csvd += 1;
Q.rural_csvd += 1;
Q.dnvp_r_share_left = Q.delegate_power_christsoc * 0.01;
Q.csvd_r += Q.dnvp_r_share_left;
Q.dnvp_r -= Q.dnvp_r_share_left;

Q.old_csvd_r = 0;
for (var record of Q.election_records) {
    record['csvd'] = 0;
}
for (var record of Q.party_support_records) {
    record['csvd'] = 0;
}
!}

= Lambach falls on the second vote!

As it was expected, the majority of old guard and even some of conservative reformist have taken down the Walther Lambach in the vote of no confidence. After the expulsion, rest of the Christian Socials and DHV followed the step of their leader and joined the relatively small CSVD, empowering it with lot of seats.

Christian Social experiment was ended here.

@survives2
on-arrival: lambach_stage = 2; workers_dnvp += 5; new_middle_dnvp += 5; {!

Q.parties.push('kvp');
Q.kvp_flee = 1;
Q.rural_dnvp *= 0.3;
Q.old_middle_dnvp *= 0.1;
Q.old_middle_kvp += 20;
Q.rural_kvp += 20;
Q.dnvp_r_share_left = (Q.delegate_power_moderates * 0.01 + Q.delegate_power_nat_cons * 0.01 + Q.delegate_power_agrarians * 0.01 + Q.delegate_power_yocon * 0.10) / 3.2;
Q.kvp_r += Q.dnvp_r_share_left;
Q.dnvp_r -= Q.dnvp_r_share_left;

Q.old_kvp_r = 0;
for (var record of Q.election_records) {
    record['kvp'] = 0;
}
for (var record of Q.party_support_records) {
    record['kvp'] = 0;
}
!}

= Lambach survives a second time — his grip is iron!

Against all expectations, Walther Lambach has beaten back a second attempt to remove him. The rump opposition, stripped of Hugenberg's resources and organisation, could not muster enough votes even among the Traditionalists and Moderates to cross the threshold.

It seems like, Walther Lambach is now undefeatable and any prospects of resistance ends here. Remnant of the opposition defected to the KVP.
